## Proposed Changes

### Database — Firestore Collections

#### [NEW] Collection: `match_queue`
```
/match_queue/{userId}
  ├── userId: string
  ├── status: 'waiting' | 'matched'
  ├── interests: string[] (optional, for v2)
  ├── createdAt: timestamp
  └── matchedRoomId: string? (set when paired)
```

#### [NEW] Collection: `anonymous_rooms`
```
/anonymous_rooms/{roomId}
  ├── user1Id: string
  ├── user2Id: string
  ├── user1Alias: string ("Stranger 1" / random pseudonym)
  ├── user2Alias: string ("Stranger 2" / random pseudonym)
  ├── status: 'active' | 'ended'
  ├── createdAt: timestamp
  ├── endedAt: timestamp?
  ├── endedBy: string? (userId who ended)
  ├── friendRequestFrom: string? (userId who sent friend request)
  ├── friendRequestStatus: 'none' | 'pending' | 'accepted' | 'declined'
  └── /messages/{messageId}
        ├── senderId: string
        ├── text: string
        ├── type: 'text' | 'system' (system messages like "Stranger wants to connect!")
        ├── timestamp: timestamp
        └── status: 'sent'
```

#### [NEW] Collection: `friend_requests`
```
/friend_requests/{requestId}
  ├── fromUserId: string
  ├── toUserId: string
  ├── anonymousRoomId: string
  ├── fromAlias: string (alias in the anonymous room)
  ├── status: 'pending' | 'accepted' | 'declined'
  ├── createdAt: timestamp
  └── respondedAt: timestamp?
```

#### [NEW] Collection: `anonymous_reports`
```
/anonymous_reports/{reportId}
  ├── reporterUserId: string
  ├── reportedUserId: string
  ├── roomId: string
  ├── reason: string
  ├── createdAt: timestamp
  └── resolved: bool
```

